        "No AI tool is installed on this computer." = "Na tomto počítači nie je nainštalovaný žiadny nástroj AI."
        "One of the pictures in your Pictures folder." = "Jeden z obrázkov v tvojom priečinku Obrázky."
        "Open the Monitor" = "Otvoriť Monitor"
        "Picture" = "Obrázok"
        "Really empty it? It does not come back." = "Naozaj vysypať? Už sa to nevráti."
        "SAFE can also be chosen on the login screen. Should the full desktop crash right after it starts, LatteOS goes to SAFE by itself." = "SAFE sa dá zvoliť aj na prihlasovacej obrazovke. Ak plná plocha spadne hneď po štarte, LatteOS prejde do SAFE sám."
        "Save" = "Uložiť"
