        "Texts, buttons and windows on this screen. A screen takes only the sizes its picture divides into." = "Texty, tlačidlá a okná na tejto obrazovke. Obrazovka berie iba veľkosti, na ktoré sa jej obraz dá rozdeliť."
        "The screens stand side by side as in the picture above. The main one carries the drops; every other has a window bar of its own." = "Obrazovky stoja vedľa seba ako na obrázku hore. Hlavná nesie kvapky; každá ďalšia má vlastnú lištu okien."
