        "Which drops are on the desktop, and putting them back in their places, is in PowerGoo › Settings on the desktop itself. The coffee they are made of is under Coffee and cup." = "Ktoré kvapky sú na ploche a ich vrátenie na miesto je v PowerGoo › Nastavenia priamo na ploche. Káva, z ktorej sú, je v časti Káva a šálka."
